62104311%\"></i><i style=\"--bar:69.92086733354145%\"></i></div><div class=\"voice-transcript\"><span>AGENT</span><strong>How can I help you today?</strong></div><div class=\"voice-bottom\"><span>Retell AI / Vapi</span><span>n8n ↗ database</span></div></div></div><div class=\"case-layout\"><div class=\"case-main\"><span class=\"section-index\">OVERVIEW</span><p class=\"case-overview\">A conversational voice agent concept for appointment booking and related requests.</p><section><h2>Solution</h2><p>Voice interactions connect to workflow integrations through n8n, webhooks, and database integrations.</p></section><section><h2>Architecture</h2><p>Retell AI or Vapi handles voice interactions; n8n and webhooks connect the conversation to supporting systems.</p></section><p class=\"case-note\">More project notes and implementation details will be added as they’re documented.</p></div><aside class=\"case-sidebar\"><div><span class=\"section-index\">CATEGORY</span><p>AI Agents</p></div><div><span class=\"section-index\">STATUS</span><p>Project</p></div><div><span class=\"section-index\">BUILT WITH</span><div class=\"tech-list case-tech\"><span>Retell AI or Vapi</span><span>n8n</span><span>Webhooks</span><span>Database integrations</span></div></div><div class=\"case-links\"><span class=\"section-index\">EXPLORE</span><span class=\"unavailable-link\">Repository not listed</span><span class=\"unavailable-link\">Live demo not listed</span></div></aside></div><div class=\"next-project\"><span class=\"section-index\">KEEP EXPLORING</span><a href=\"/projects\">View all projects <span>↗</span></a></div></article><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><a class=\"wordmark\" href=\"/\">TAHA<span>·</span></a><p>Thoughtful software, built one useful thing at a time.</p><div class=\"footer-links\"><a href=\"/#projects\">Projects</a><a href=\"/#about\">About</a><a href=\"/writing\">Writing</a><a href=\"/#contact\">Contact</a></div></div><div class